# oracle: pair_style hybrid/overlay eam sw/mod saip/metal/tmd 16.0 1 - the examples' gold/MoS2 heterostructure (3 Au layers and 1 MoS2 layer, 1590 atoms, the example's data file), 10 NVE steps; compute pair c_0 (eam), c_1 (sw/mod) and c_2 (saip/metal/tmd: [attractive, repulsive])
# measured (engine vs native, black box; rel over |value| >= 1e-6; per-atom scale max(1,|value|)): thermo max abs 5.6e-11, max rel 1.7e-13; per-atom max scaled 7.3e-14
# oracle-inputs: w102il_saip_au_mos2.data
# oracle-potentials: Au_u3.eam tmd.sw.mod TMDAu.SAIP
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           metal
boundary        p p p
atom_style      full
read_data       w102il_saip_au_mos2.data
mass            1 196.96657
mass            2 32.065
mass            3 95.95
mass            4 32.065
group           gold type 1
group           mos2 type 2 3 4
pair_style      hybrid/overlay eam sw/mod saip/metal/tmd 16.0 1
pair_coeff      1 1 eam Au_u3.eam
pair_coeff      * * sw/mod tmd.sw.mod NULL S Mo S
pair_coeff      * * saip/metal/tmd TMDAu.SAIP Au S Mo S
compute         0 all pair eam
compute         1 all pair sw/mod
compute         2 all pair saip/metal/tmd
thermo_style    custom step pe etotal press c_0 c_1 c_2[1] c_2[2]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
velocity        all set 0.0 0.0 0.0
velocity        mos2 create 300.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
velocity        gold create 300.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix             intsub gold nve
fix             intrib mos2 nve
timestep        1e-3
run             0
run             10
